  <data name="LeAudio_Stage_RemovingPairings" xml:space="preserve"><value>Removing this PC's pairing with the earbuds…</value></data>
  <data name="LeAudio_Stage_WaitingForCleanup" xml:space="preserve"><value>Waiting for Windows to clean up the old pairing (up to about 45 seconds). Keep the earbuds in pairing mode when switching to LE Audio…</value></data>
  <data name="LeAudio_Stage_WaitingForPairingMode" xml:space="preserve"><value>Put both earbuds in the case, open the lid and hold the case button until the light flashes (waiting up to 2 minutes)…</value></data>
