  <data name="LeAudio_Result_Paired" xml:space="preserve"><value>Switched to LE Audio. Put the earbuds on and choose "Speakers (earbud name)" as the output in Sound settings.</value></data>
  <data name="LeAudio_Result_PrimaryOnly" xml:space="preserve"><value>Only one earbud was paired, so sound may play on one side only. Enter pairing mode again and retry.</value></data>
  <data name="LeAudio_Result_Removed" xml:space="preserve"><value>This PC's earbud pairings have been removed. Put the earbuds in pairing mode, click Open Windows Bluetooth settings, then choose Add device → Bluetooth to manually pair them for Classic Bluetooth audio.</value></data>
