  <data name="LeAudio_Result_PairingFailed" xml:space="preserve"><value>Pairing failed. Put the earbuds in pairing mode again and retry, or add them again in Windows Bluetooth settings.</value></data>
  <data name="LeAudio_Cancelled" xml:space="preserve"><value>Cancelled. If the pairing was already removed, retry or add the earbuds again in Windows Bluetooth settings.</value></data>
